Name: dndlights Control Panel
Description: Open an interactive sidebar with buttons for every dndlights scene, spell, and effect. Requires the shiny and miniUI packages. NOTE: while this panel is open the R session is blocked, so other dndlights addin keyboard shortcuts will not fire — close the panel before using voice/keyboard triggers.
Binding: dnd_addin
Interactive: true

Name: Fireball (Boule de feu)
Description: Cast Fireball. French voice trigger: Boule de feu.
Binding: fireball
Interactive: false

